%% Source: docs/blueprint/BP-02-data-flow.md
%% Diagram: Pipeline Loop

sequenceDiagram
    participant Watcher as File watcher
    participant Timer as Periodic timer
    participant Coordinator as pipeline/loop.ts
    participant Adapter
    participant Store as SQLite store
    participant Routing
    participant Sink

    Watcher->>Coordinator: fs-change event
    Timer->>Coordinator: periodic scan
    Coordinator->>Coordinator: drain one serial ingest queue
    Coordinator->>Adapter: findChanged(hint)
    Adapter-->>Coordinator: ConversationRef[]

    loop each changed ref
        Coordinator->>Adapter: loadConversation(ref)
        Adapter-->>Coordinator: ConversationBundle | null
        Coordinator->>Store: writeBundle(bundle)
        Store-->>Coordinator: { changed, revision }
    end

    Coordinator->>Coordinator: enqueue one push if any bundle changed
    Coordinator->>Store: conversationsNeedingPush(sinkId)
    Store-->>Coordinator: dirty conversation IDs

    loop each dirty conversation
        Coordinator->>Store: getConversation(id)
        Coordinator->>Store: getMessages(id)
        Coordinator->>Store: getToolCalls(id)
        Coordinator->>Routing: route(conversation, routes, sinks)
        Routing-->>Coordinator: matching sinks
        Coordinator->>Sink: push({ attemptedRevision, conversation, messages, toolCalls })
        Sink-->>Coordinator: PushResult
        Coordinator->>Store: recordPushResult(...)
    end
